# Standupify needs no configuration — `npm start` finds Nightshift and
# ComfyUI on this computer by itself. These optional overrides are read from
# your shell environment when the defaults don't fit (e.g. engines on
# unusual ports or another drive):
#
#   NIGHTSHIFT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8088      # default: read from Nightshift's own config.toml
#   NIGHTSHIFT_TOKEN=...                       # default: read from Nightshift's proxy-token file
#   NIGHTSHIFT_STATE_DIR=...                   # where Nightshift keeps config.toml + proxy-token
#   COMFYUI_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8188          # default: tries 8188, 8000 (Desktop), 8189
#   COMFYUI_DIR=D:\ComfyUI                     # an existing ComfyUI install to launch
#   PORT=3210                                  # Standupify's own port
